something like (Monster Base MR
percentile)/(100+CasterLevel-MonsterLevel), and in case of scrolls,
CasterLevel is fixed at 9.  So for higher level monsters like Ki-rin
and Archons are even more difficult to tame than what their base MR
indicates.  I think Ki-rin is about 97% resist rate, and Archons are
89% resist rate against scrolls.  Dragons should be fairly easy though.
 Definitely try dragons.  Or, try to learn the Charm Monster spell and
try to cast it.  If he is using Magic Missle as a Main offensive
weapon, he wants to get his exp level high up anyways, so it'll be
slightly easier for him to tame those higher level monsters as well.
